    "body": "## Summary\n- link profile targets in `VideoCard` and `FullscreenVideoItem` directly to `/profile/{npub}`\n- keep those links using the shared `buildProfilePath()` helper\n- skip the ProfilePage subdomain redirect in development mode\n\n## Motivation\nProfile links in the video player were taking an unnecessary redirect hop through the generic `/:nip19` route before landing on the canonical profile route. This trims that hop while keeping the existing production subdomain redirect behavior intact. The development-only guard avoids local redirect churn when working on profile pages.\n\n## Testing\n- `npm run test`\n- manual check of the PR diff against existing profile routing helpers\n\n## Visual Changes\n- no visual change\n",
