    "body": "**Summary**\r\n\r\nOverhaul contributor docs for the web repo: new CONTRIBUTING.md, ARCHITECTURE.md, HUMAN_VS_MACHINE.md, slimmed AGENTS.md, and a tool-agnostic `.agents/` skills directory.\r\n\r\n**Changes**\r\n\r\n- Add `CONTRIBUTING.md` [adapted from divine-mobile's approach](https://github.com/divinevideo/divine-mobile/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md), scoped to the web stack and contribution policy\r\n- Add `ARCHITECTURE.md` covering stack, entry points, source layout, state, routing, styling, build, deps, lint, testing\r\n- Add `HUMAN_VS_MACHINE.md` with the `.ai-ack` gate for AI agents\r\n- Slim `AGENTS.md` from 52 to 32 lines (\"read-first\" refs and quick commands only)\r\n- Move skills from `.claude/skills/` to `.agents/skills/` with five modules: coding-conventions, testing-guidelines, pr-conventions, project-structure, spa-subdomain-root-render (meant to keep AGENTS.md small so agents load proper context when needed)\r\n- Symlink `.claude/skills` to `.agents/skills/` for Claude compatibility\r\n- Update `.github/copilot-instructions.md` to point at AGENTS.md and .agents/SKILLS.md",
